 of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Caroline's grandma is from Sweden, which is Caroline's home country. (event_time: None)\n  - Caroline moved from her home country 4 years ago. (event_time: 2019-06-09T19:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline's dream is to create a safe and loving home. (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline has a dream to adopt and provide a loving home. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to ensure that the kids have a safe and loving home. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline wants to give a loving home to kids who need it. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline is being helped by her friends during her transition. (event_time: 2023-07-06T20:18:00Z)\n  - Caroline is being helped by her family during her transition. (event_time: 2023-07-06T20:18:00Z)\n  - Melanie is asking Caroline what activities she is looking forward to next. (event_time: 2023-07-03T13:36:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to give a home to needy kids (event_time: 2023-10-22T09:55:00Z)\n  - Caroline is eager to begin the process of adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Melanie is asking Caroline about the types of jobs Caroline is considering. (event_time: 2023-05-08T13:56:00Z)\n  - Caroline's future family is going to be lucky to have her (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:14:00Z)\n  - Caroline intends to provide a safe, loving home for kids through adoption. (event_time: 2023-10-13T10:31:00Z)\n  - Caroline pursued her ambitions (event_time: 2023-08-28T15:19:00Z)\n  - Melanie asks Caroline for recent updates about what has been happening. (event_time: 2023-07-06T20:18:00Z)\n  - Caroline is asking Melanie how Melanie's family has been supportive during Melanie's move. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n  - Caroline is asking Melanie about finding peace. (event_time: 2023-07-15T13:51:00Z)\n  - Melanie asks Carolin