ueberry muffins"],"present_elements":["Roasted Chicken","sushi"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_7","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_7_qa_180","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What did Deborah do with their mom's old friends?","golden_answer":"reminisced and looked through photos","hypothesis":"On September 15, 2023, Deborah reconnected with her mom's old friends. During this time, they provided comfort to her by sharing stories about her mom, which reminded Deborah of how lucky she is to have had her mom. This experience was emotional for Deborah, bringing a mix of happy and sad feelings, but overall it was comforting.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Deborah reconnected with her mom's old friends since their last conversation. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - mom's old friends provided comfort to Deborah through reconnecting. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - Deborah's mom's old friends told stories to Deborah. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - The old friends belonged to or were associated with Deborah's mom. (event_time: None)\n  - The stories from her mom's old friends reminded Deborah how lucky she is to have had her mom. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - Deborah appreciates her mom more after hearing stories from her mom's friends. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - Jolene believes the moments Deborah spent with her mom's old friends must have been meaningful to Deborah. (event_time: 2023-09-15T15:09:00Z)\n  - Jolene ask