ed.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Audrey spent most of her free time taking care of her four dogs and ensuring they are happy and healthy. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Audrey received tips to help with her dogs' problems (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey took a dog grooming course (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey learned many techniques, described as tips, from the dog grooming course (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey started taking care of the grooming of her pups herself (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey started agility classes with her pups. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Audrey cares for her pups (implied continuity from previous messages). (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey feels closer to her pups because she is taking care of their grooming (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks Audrey is doing an amazing job taking care of her pups. (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Andrew asked Audrey what actions she will take to help with the problems related to Audrey's dogs. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey learned a new skill during August (event_time: 2023-08-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Audrey is busy taking care of her pets (event_time: 2023-05-03T17:41:00Z)\n  - Audrey is using positive reinforcement techniques to address the dogs' issues. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey's agility classes involve her pups. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew stated that Audrey's dogs keep her busy. (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Audrey anticipates making wonderful memories with her dogs. (event_time: 2023-10-28T14:36:00Z)\n  - Audrey has hiked with her dogs. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Audrey refers to her dogs as her furry friends. (event_time: 2023-04-16T16:19:00Z)\n  - Audrey noticed that her dogs were not acting norm