 fame: Calvin, inspired by a friend attending his performance, reflected on how relationships and being around certain people spark feelings from when he and friends talked about getting famous as teenagers.\n  - team: Calvin mentioned his team is part of his strong support system that helps him manage his overwhelming job demands. He was also with his crew at a fancy gala in Boston.\n  - Dave: Dave enjoys photography, taking pictures of local scenery. He talked with Calvin about Calvin's inspiring chat with an artist at an event.\n  - opportunity: Calvin mentioned being greatly privileged to have been granted this opportunity, which he finds satisfying to bring back to life.\n  - Dave: Dave congratulated Calvin on his album release and expressed enthusiasm for live music. Dave invited Calvin to see his cool cars in his garage.\n  - strum: Calvin mentioned that every 'mark and strum holds a story' about his performance on a big stage.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2031,"context_chars":8555,"retrieval_duration":0.16420745849609375,"response_duration":2.850264310836792,"total_duration":3.0144717693328857,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer touches on the same key concepts as the gold answer, including reminding himself of his passion for goals, getting help from others (supportive people), and taking breaks (engaging in favorite activities), thus it is aligned with the original intent.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all the necessary information to answer the question about how Calvin stays motivated when faced with setbacks. It includes specific details about Calvin reminding himself of his passion for his goals, relying on supportive people, and taking breaks to recharge, which align perfectly with the el