inds every day on set awesome and enjoys showing her vision, with Nate asking about the coolest moment.\n  - script: Joanna is filming a movie from her road-trip script. An actor praised the script, making Joanna excited and giving her chills.\n  - acting: Joanna enjoys acting, especially dramas and emotionally-driven films, and might try it if given the opportunity while currently focusing on her writers group.\n  - the set: Joanna is filming her own movie on the set, which she describes as awesome and full of potential every day.\n  - time off: Joanna mentioned that taking breaks and reducing stress is nice and asked Nate for movie recommendations.\n  - movie script: Joanna is filming a movie based on her road-trip script. She previously hoped for big-screen distribution, and Nate asked about future script submissions.\n  - the path forward: Nate is excited about the future; Joanna previously encouraged Nate not to quit, believing the path forward will show up soon.\n  - fantasy movies: Nate likes fantasy movies because they spark his imagination, following Joanna's question about his favorite fantasy or sci-fi movie.\n  - director: Joanna hopes a director falls in love with her screenplay to get it on the big screen.\n  - theater: Joanna mentioned that watching a movie in a theater is different from watching it on a comfy couch.\n  - happiness: Joanna stated she will always remember moments that bring happiness and reminded Nate that it's important to stay happy and de-stress by doing what makes him happy.\n  - a person: Joanna experienced seeing characters and dialogue she wrote acted out, calling it an amazing and rewarding experience that was the third time this has happened.\n  - the trail: Joanna found an awesome, gorgeous hiking trail in her hometown. Nate is curious to see what the trail looks like and heard there is a nice trail just north of where he lives.\n  - old notebooks: Joanna found old notebooks containing her early writings last week, showing her progress. Nate asked Joanna what she was working on in that notebook.\n  - meetings: Joanna set up meetings with movie producers to discuss her script and vision, which included elements of self-discovery. The meetings went well, leaving her feeling hopeful and inspired.\n  - journey: Joanna values the journey, appreciating happy moments to stay focused on dreams, and looks forward to showing it to Nate.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1992,"context_chars":7947,"retrieval_duration":0.19676637649536133,"response_duration":1.8718106746673584,"total_duration":2.0685770511627197,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions 'The Lord of the Rings' and the date May 1, 2022, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides clear information that Joanna watched 'The Lord of the Rings' Trilogy on May 1, 2022, which directly answers the question. The relevant fact is explicitly stated with the correct date, making it sufficient to construct a complete answer.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Joanna watched 'The Lord of the Rings' Trilogy. (event_time: 2022-05-01T00:00:00Z)"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_5","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_5_qa_23","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What are some problems that Andrew faces before he adopted Toby?","golden_answer":"Finding the right dog and pet-friendly apartments close to open spaces","hypothesis":"Before adopting Toby, Andrew faced several problems:\n\n1. **Difficulty Finding the Right Dog**: Andrew had trouble finding a suitable dog that matched his needs and expectations. This was noted on July 8, 2023.\n\n2. **Concerns About Limiting Growth**: Andrew was worried about potentially limiting Toby's growth and development, which he expressed on August 4, 2023.\n\n3. **Waiting to Bond**: Andrew was waiting to bond better with Toby, indicating that he felt there was a need for a stronger connection, as mentioned on August 24, 2023.\n\nThese challenges highlight Andrew's concerns and the emotional complexities he faced prior to bringing Toby into his life.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Andrew mentions that Toby is still very young, which makes something difficult for Andrew. (event_time: 2023-09-06T19:49:00Z)\n  - Andrew is waiting to bond better with Toby. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Andrew is concerned about limiting Toby. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - The pup adopted by Andrew is still getting used to Toby. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew hopes to have a strong bond with Toby. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Audrey suggests that Andrew should take care of Toby first. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew wants to ensure he is not limiting Toby's growth. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew has difficulty finding the right dog (event_time: 2023-07-08T09:48:00Z)\n  - Toby is Andrew's pet/companion. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Andrew adopted another dog (referred to as doggo) recently. (event_time: 2023-11-22T00:00:00Z)\n  - Andrew recently acquired a puppy named Toby. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Having Toby happy and healthy is suggested as a first step before going all in for more dogs. (event_time: 2023-11-04T19:59:00Z)\n  - Andrew is the owner of Toby. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew recently adopted a pup from a pet shelter. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew is asking what games Toby likes to play at the park. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Andrew intends to take Toby to a nearby park. (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Andrew likes Toby (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks Andrew how the newly adopted pup is doing. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Toby is bringing a lot of joy to Andrew. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew hopes that Buddy and Toby become buddies. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew hopes that Buddy and Toby become buddies. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks Toby should go hiking with him. (event_time: 2023-08-04T11:05:00Z)\n  - Toby needs some time to get along with the adopted pup. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Audrey asks about the condition of the pup Andrew recently adopted in its new home. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Toby is Andrew's girlfriend. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Andrew is going to the beach with Toby next month. (event_time: 2023-11-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Andrew will remember tips regarding grooming Toby (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Andrew sends a picture of Toby. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Andrew sent the picture of Toby. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Audrey adopted another puppy named Pixie as a surprise for Andrew. (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - Toby: Toby is Andrew's pet who needs time to adjust to a new home environment with Scout and Buddy. Andrew plans to take Toby to a nearby park for fresh air.\n  - growth: Andrew is concerned about limiting Toby's growth, seeking advice to ensure Toby's development is supported but not constrained.\n  - home: Audrey finds plants make a home peaceful. Andrew adopted a pup that is adjusting to its new home, where it needs time to get along with Toby.\n  - puppy: Andrew adopted a new puppy named Toby. Andrew s