hike. (event_time: 2022-05-12T15:35:00Z)\n  - Joanna engages with Nature. (event_time: 2022-04-17T18:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna enjoys exploring nature. (event_time: 2022-01-21T19:31:00Z)\n  - Joanna likes the idea a few times (event_time: 2022-01-21T19:31:00Z)\n  - The spot Joanna loved was on her hike. (event_time: 2022-05-12T15:35:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends to keep making great new memories. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Joanna saw a gorgeous sunset while hiking the other day. (event_time: 2022-04-08T00:00:00Z)\n  - Joanna invited Nate to join her on the trails sometime. (event_time: 2022-05-12T15:35:00Z)\n  - Joanna is planning on hiking with some buddies this weekend. (event_time: 2022-06-03T17:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna found Whispering Falls to be peaceful and serene (event_time: 2022-05-12T15:35:00Z)\n  - Nature inspires Joanna. (event_time: 2022-05-12T15:35:00Z)\n  - Joanna has been conducting research non-stop. (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Joanna might try to convince Nate to go hiking with her sometime. (event_time: 2022-04-17T18:44:00Z)\n  - Joanna's hiking experiences sound like a blast to Nate. (event_time: 2022-05-12T15:35:00Z)\n  - Joanna considers Nature to be her haven. (event_time: 2022-04-17T18:44:00Z)\n  - Being surrounded by the beauty of Nature is calming for Joanna. (event_time: 2022-05-12T15:35:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - amazing trails: Joanna found more amazing trails while hiking in her town; she described the experience as awesome and now considers herself an expert hiker.\n  - town: Joanna discovered more amazing hiking trails in her town recently, finding the experience awesome.\n  - trails: Joanna found amazing trails while hiking in her town, described as an awesome experience that made her feel like an expert hiker. She felt inspired to write a drama about the trails.\n  - hiking trail: Joanna found more amazing hiking trails in her town, suggesting Na