-09T13:25:00Z)\n  - Gina believes Jon has the right attitude. (event_time: 2023-05-27T19:18:00Z)\n  - Jon finds that dancing requires hard work. (event_time: 2023-02-08T09:32:00Z)\n  - Jon must make time to practice Dance. (event_time: 2023-01-29T14:32:00Z)\n  - Dancing leads to happiness for Jon (event_time: 2023-04-09T10:33:00Z)\n  - Jon's dance crew performed on a stage during a competition. (event_time: 2022-01-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Jon can still enjoy Dance at their own studio. (event_time: 2023-04-09T10:33:00Z)\n  - The dance competition is associated with Jon's dance studio. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Jon's dance crew participated in and won first in a local competition. (event_time: 2022-01-20T00:00:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - festival: Jon attended a festival performance where many people complimented his dance moves, reinforcing his passion for dancing.\n  - dance moves: Jon mentioned a recent festival performance where many people complemented his dance moves, reminding him of his passion for dancing.\n  - Jon: Jon is rehearsing, working on business plans, and is motivated by dancing. He is planning for his studio to welcome dancers of all ages and backgrounds.\n  - young dancers: Jon is inspired by the young dancers' passion and commitment; he wants his dance studio to be a place of support and encouragement for them.\n  - Jon: Jon turned his love of dance into a business after losing his job. He is determined to make the studio work and enjoys dancing as self-expression.\n  - hip-hop: Jon's dance group practices various dance styles, including hip-hop, and is finishing choreography for a festival performance next month.\n  - dance fam: Jon is preparing for a dance competition next month and hopes to get recognition from the dance fam.\n  - stage: Jon performed dance moves on stage at a festival, which was complemented by many people. Gina complimented Jon's appearance on stage.\n  - love for dance: Jon thinks about his love for dance and how it makes him feel, noting it has been his stress-buster since childhood.\n  - Jon: Jon is rehearsing hard and working on business plans, finding dancing keeps him going. Gina is supportive, encouraging him not to give up on his dream.\n  - Jon: Jon owns a dance studio, recently performed on stage to many compliments, is hitting the gym, and is growing his venture. He is finding handling changes hard but remains positive.\n  - dance comps or shows: Gina won first place at regionals in dance competitions at fifteen. Jon is preparing for a dance competition next month to showcase his skills to the dance community.\n  - dance crew: Jon's dance crew won first place in a local competition last year. Jon wants to share the intensity from that experience with others.\n  - dance session: Gina suggested planning a dance session with Jon soon. Jon confirmed dance practice has been fun and exhausting; he plans to go full-time with his business idea.\n  - aspiring dancers: Jon is excited to guide and mentor aspiring dancers on their dreams.\n  - dance floor: Jon's dance studio is facing challenges, but he is determined to make it work and rock the dance floor to teach others to chase their dreams.\n  - dance: Jon is rehearsing hard, working on business plans for his dance studio. Gina believes the studio will be a go-to spot for self-expression.\n  - Jon: Jon is starting a dance studio and received mentorship from a business professional. Gina expressed pride and support for Jon's endeavors.\n  - performances and judging: Jon's dance studio and other schools will participate in a creative night of performances and judging.\n  - choreography: Jon is finishing up choreography for a performance at a nearby festival next month; the group rehearses dances ranging from contemporary to hip-hop.\n  - friends: Gina mentioned being at dance class with a group of friends last Friday. She looks forward to Jon's studio being a go-to spot for self-expression.\n  - Jon: Jon runs a dance studio, has been rehearsing hard, and is working on business plans. Gina told Jon 'Just do it!' after he mentioned the stress.\n  - Jon: Jon started his own dance studio after losing his job. He finds starting the business scary but is driven by his love for dance, which has been a stress-buster since childhood.\n  - dancing: Jon has been rehearsing hard and working on business plans for his dance studio, finding that dancing keeps him going despite the stress.\n  - workshops: Jon is offering dance classes, workshops, and one-on-one mentoring to help dancers reach their full potential as part of expanding his dance studio.\n  - Jon: Jon is working hard on his business despite obstacles. Gina supports him, encouraging his drive and predicting he will succeed in a competition.\n  - Jon: Jon is running a business (dance studio), determined despite challenges, and asked Gina for marketing advice to reach his target audience.\n  - Jon: Jon's dance studio faces challenges. He is determined and seeking investors; Gina suggested an online platform could help him showcase the studio.\n  - centers: Jon is offering dance workshops and classes to local schools and centers as part of expanding his dance studio's social media presence.\n  - dancers: Jon's dance studio will welcome dancers of all ages and backgrounds. Gina supports Jon's efforts for the studio, which will offer one-on-one mentoring and training.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1996,"context_chars":8033,"retrieval_duration":0.44084763526916504,"response_duration":6.418142080307007,"total_duration":6.858989715576172,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer conveys Jon's positive attitude towards the dance festival, aligning with the gold answer's implication of being 'glad'.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides sufficient information to determine Jon's attitude towards being part of the dance festival. It includes multiple facts that indicate Jon's positive feelings about dance, such as his belief that dance brings people together, his passion for dancing, and the enjoyment he derives from performing. Specifically, the fact that Jon received many compliments on his dance moves at the festival and that dancing leads to happiness for him strongly suggests a glad attitude. Therefore, all necessary elements to conclude that Jon's attitude is 'glad' are present in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Jon believes that dance has the power to bring people together and create sweet moments.","Jon views dancing as a means of self-expression.","Jon hopes to get recognition ('props') from the dance fam at the dance competition next month.","Jon considers Dance a really cool way to express themselves.","Jon finds dancing to be second nature to him.","Jon attended the festival.","Jon intends to show his skillz at the dance competition next month.","Dance provides an escape for Jon to be himself.","Jon is passionate about dancing.","Jon received many compliments on his dance moves at the festival.","Dancing leads to happiness for Jon."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_1","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_1_qa_80","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What plans does Jon have after receiving advice at the networking event?","golden_answer":"Sprucing up his business plan, tweaking his pitch to investors, and working on an online platform.","hypothesis":"After receiving advice at the networking event on July 21, 2023, Jon plans to pursue his goals for the dance studio, improve his business plan, and continue seeking investors. He is motivated to make his business dreams come true and is trying to make his plan work.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Jon received advice. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Gina asked Jon about his plans following the advice he received regarding his successful night. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon attends networking events. (event_time: 2023-06-21T14:15:00Z)\n  - Jon attended networking events yesterday to make things happen. (event_time: 2023-06-20T14:15:00Z)\n  - Jon received good advice from the investors. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon attended the event. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Gina complimented Jon on his guts and drive for attending networking events. (event_time: 2023-06-21T14:15:00Z)\n  - The picture Jon has is from a networking event. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon attended an event that he described as awesome. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon has a picture from the last networking event. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon expects to attend the grand opening event tomorrow. (event_time: 2023-06-20T00:00:00Z)\n  - Jon is trying to make his plan work. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Gina offers advice to Jon. (event_time: 2023-04-25T11:24:00Z)\n  - Jon experiences benefits from Networking, according to Gina. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon met some investors at the event. (event_time: 2023-07-21T17:44:00Z)\n  - Jon intends to start his own business. (event_time: 2023-01-20T16:04:00Z)\n  - Jon will see Gina at the event. (event_time: 2023-04-03T13:26:00Z)\n  - Jon intends to keep pushing and working toward making his dreams happen. (event_time: 2023-06-13T20:29:00Z)\n  - Jon asked Gina for advice for someone just starting out. (event_time: 2023-06-16T21:38:00Z)\n  - Jon i